  ('vocabulary', 'hard', 'multiple_choice', 'Small delivery services began to proliferate across the city.', 'After reviewing all four options, choose the closest meaning of "proliferate" as it is used here.', 'After reviewing all four options, choose the closest meaning of "proliferate" as it is used here.', '[{"label":"A","text":"prove a claim to be false"},{"label":"B","text":"fundamentally different"},{"label":"C","text":"increase rapidly in number"},{"label":"D","text":"expressed clearly and easy to understand"}]', 'C', 'In this context, "proliferate" means "increase rapidly in number." The surrounding details support that meaning.', 'published', '{"stimulus_type":"text","blueprint":"context-meaning-3"}', '3e063abb569fd3d472d9c5097aafae5fb50f8a4b587b370e9676b61e3ec38520', 'english-bank-2000-v2', '{"generator":"scripts/generate-question-bank.mjs","version":"2.0.0","blueprint":"context-meaning-3","ordinal":83,"locale":"en"}', 'english-bank:vocabulary:hard:083'),
