  ('reading', 'medium', 'multiple_choice', 'The reading club was scheduled at the bookshop on Saturday. Because the power was interrupted, Nora moved the opening from 2:45 p.m. to 5:30 p.m. Most participants accepted the change, although two asked for a recorded session.', 'After reviewing all four options, which statement best summarizes the information?', 'After reviewing all four options, which statement best summarizes the information?', '[{"label":"A","text":"The reading club proceeded at its original time"},{"label":"B","text":"A venue change divided the participants"},{"label":"C","text":"A problem caused the reading club schedule to change"},{"label":"D","text":"A recording replaced the live reading club"}]', 'C', 'The central idea is the schedule adjustment caused by an unexpected problem.', 'published', '{"stimulus_type":"text","blueprint":"passage-main-idea"}', '00c46bc43a94474d14922e8d6a4e6761129f0422b979e4dbe4a7842f72cf65f8', 'english-bank-2000-v2', '{"generator":"scripts/generate-question-bank.mjs","version":"2.0.0","blueprint":"passage-main-idea","ordinal":108,"locale":"en"}', 'english-bank:reading:medium:108'),
  ('reading', 'medium', 'multiple_choice', 'The history display was scheduled at the science lab on Monday. Because the main speaker was ill, Clara moved the opening from 9:15 a.m. to 1:00 p.m. Most participants accepted the change, although two asked for a recorded session.', 'After reviewing all four options, why was the opening moved?', 'After reviewing all four options, why was the opening moved?', '[{"label":"A","text":"Too few people registered"},{"label":"B","text":"The project had already finished"},{"label":"C","text":"The main speaker was ill"},{"label":"D","text":"A different venue was cheaper"}]', 'C', 'The passage identifies "the main speaker was ill" as the cause of the schedule change.', 'published', '{"stimulus_type":"text","blueprint":"passage-cause-effect"}', 'f3c1dcebcb2815d9e0ce40ba82047616a078f324f2f7965a8bafca1c2089ac2e', 'english-bank-2000-v2', '{"generator":"scripts/generate-question-bank.mjs","version":"2.0.0","blueprint":"passage-cause-effect","ordinal":109,"locale":"en"}', 'english-bank:reading:medium:109'),
  ('reading', 'medium', 'multiple_choice', 'The recycling drive was scheduled at the art studio on Wednesday. Because several volunteers were absent, Hana moved the opening from 5:30 p.m. to 8:00 a.m. Most participants accepted the change, although two asked for a recorded session.', 'After reviewing all four options, what can reasonably be inferred about the two participants?', 'After reviewing all four options, what can reasonably be inferred about the two participants?', '[{"label":"A","text":"They opposed the project itself"},{"label":"B","text":"They might not be able to attend at the new time"},{"label":"C","text":"They had already watched the recording"},{"label":"D","text":"They caused the original problem"}]', 'B', 'Requesting a recording suggests that the revised time may not work for them.', 'published', '{"stimulus_type":"text","blueprint":"passage-inference"}', '700a7b68a817e6ee197e721a03117e46090e0fdfc0ec4c63cca3b7f171330789', 'english-bank-2000-v2', '{"generator":"scripts/generate-question-bank.mjs","version":"2.0.0","blueprint":"passage-inference","ordinal":110,"locale":"en"}', 'english-bank:reading:medium:110'),
  ('reading', 'medium', 'multiple_choice', 'The health campaign was scheduled at the city museum on Friday. Because the permit was delayed, Mateo moved the opening from 1:00 p.m. to 4:10 p.m. Most participants accepted the change, although two asked for a recorded session.', 'After reviewing all four options, what happened after the problem arose?', 'After reviewing all four options, what happened after the problem arose?', '[{"label":"A","text":"Two participants withdrew from the project"},{"label":"B","text":"The organizers changed the event date"},{"label":"C","text":"The participants selected another venue"},{"label":"D","text":"Mateo changed the opening time"}]', 'D', 'After the problem, Mateo moved the opening to a later time.', 'published', '{"stimulus_type":"text","blueprint":"passage-sequence"}', '1bbb908d382e62a9643face44a7d10b28bf860ec1ea0981b77040bab5ba1f1a3', 'english-bank-2000-v2', '{"generator":"scripts/generate-question-bank.mjs","version":"2.0.0","blueprint":"passage-sequence","ordinal":111,"locale":"en"}', 'english-bank:reading:medium:111'),
  ('reading', 'hard', 'multiple_choice', 'A review of the recycling drive praised its community impact but questioned its long-term funding. Aisha, the coordinator, argued that volunteer growth would offset rising costs. The reviewer acknowledged that possibility while noting that the claim relied on one unusually successful month at the library.', 'How does the reviewer treat the coordinator''s prediction?', 'How does the reviewer treat the coordinator''s prediction?', '[{"label":"A","text":"As likely because volunteer growth is guaranteed"},{"label":"B","text":"As doubtful because community impact is unimportant"},{"label":"C","text":"As convincing despite uncertainty about future costs"},{"label":"D","text":"As possible but insufficiently supported"}]', 'D', 'The reviewer acknowledges the possibility but challenges the limited evidence behind it.', 'published', '{"stimulus_type":"text","blueprint":"passage-author-attitude"}', '9d9ee58f9edac738c9cd41db52e623036433bc2381fa53b8d42b77881f70056c', 'english-bank-2000-v2', '{"generator":"scripts/generate-question-bank.mjs","version":"2.0.0","blueprint":"passage-author-attitude","ordinal":1,"locale":"en"}', 'english-bank:reading:hard:001'),
  ('reading', 'hard', 'multiple_choice', 'A review of the health campaign praised its community impact but questioned its long-term funding. Farah, the coordinator, argued that volunteer growth would offset rising costs. The reviewer acknowledged that possibility while noting that the claim relied on one unusually successful month at the train station.', 'What weakness does the reviewer identify in the argument?', 'What weakness does the reviewer identify in the argument?', '[{"label":"A","text":"It measures volunteer growth without considering community impact"},{"label":"B","text":"It compares current costs with those of another project"},{"label":"C","text":"It assumes that funding has already been withdrawn"},{"label":"D","text":"It generalizes from one unusually successful month"}]', 'D', 'The prediction rests on one exceptional month, which may not represent a sustainable pattern.', 'published', '{"stimulus_type":"text","blueprint":"passage-evidence-evaluation"}', '8df0623615a3d41afc43424bc11e13c3f89e117ca61d5aa7ef745592f05b7676', 'english-bank-2000-v2', '{"generator":"scripts/generate-question-bank.mjs","version":"2.0.0","blueprint":"passage-evidence-evaluation","ordinal":2,"locale":"en"}', 'english-bank:reading:hard:002'),
  ('reading', 'hard', 'multiple_choice', 'A review of the music recital praised its community impact but questioned its long-term funding. Kai, the coordinator, argued that volunteer growth would offset rising costs. The reviewer acknowledged that possibility while noting that the claim relied on one unusually successful month at the bookshop.', 'Which tension is central to the discussion?', 'Which tension is central to the discussion?', '[{"label":"A","text":"Growing volunteer interest versus declining community value"},{"label":"B","text":"Stable operating costs versus uncertain public support"},{"label":"C","text":"Short-term funding losses versus proven long-term savings"},{"label":"D","text":"Immediate community value versus uncertain financial sustainability"}]', 'D', 'The project''s positive current impact is contrasted with doubts about future funding.', 'published', '{"stimulus_type":"text","blueprint":"passage-contrast"}', '5e3b1c3df13169689274c2208cc7df46a6035ac43797a8e14bede7ec00672761', 'english-bank-2000-v2', '{"generator":"scripts/generate-question-bank.mjs","version":"2.0.0","blueprint":"passage-contrast","ordinal":3,"locale":"en"}', 'english-bank:reading:hard:003'),
