  ('speaking', 'hard', 'multiple_choice', 'Interviewer to George: "The short-term results for the music recital are encouraging. Are you certain they will last?"', 'Choose the most effective response.', 'Choose the most effective response.', '[{"label":"A","text":"\"Yes, the current trend is strong enough to remove any doubt.\""},{"label":"B","text":"\"Probably, because short-term results usually continue unchanged.\""},{"label":"C","text":"\"No, short-term evidence tells us nothing useful about the future.\""},{"label":"D","text":"\"No. They are promising, but we need data from a longer period before drawing that conclusion.\""}]', 'D', 'The response uses the advanced discussion skill of hedging a claim while remaining precise and constructive.', 'published', '{"stimulus_type":"text","blueprint":"hedging-a-claim"}', '7ea6c8d0b2ecb77bbf0581ff8ff5e708c88a3cdadb9fe8e16338670c9148f084', 'english-bank-2000-v2', '{"generator":"scripts/generate-question-bank.mjs","version":"2.0.0","blueprint":"hedging-a-claim","ordinal":3,"locale":"en"}', 'english-bank:speaking:hard:003'),
