  ('writing', 'hard', 'multiple_choice', 'Aisha''s Monday report about the recycling drive at the library claims: "The project succeeded because attendance rose during its final week."', 'Choose the revision that avoids overclaiming from limited evidence.', 'Choose the revision that avoids overclaiming from limited evidence.', '[{"label":"A","text":"The final week proves beyond doubt that every part of the recycling drive succeeded."},{"label":"B","text":"Attendance rose, so no other evidence is relevant."},{"label":"C","text":"Higher final-week attendance suggests that the recycling drive gained momentum, although other measures are needed to judge its overall success."},{"label":"D","text":"The recycling drive succeeded in every possible way."}]', 'C', 'The revision states what the evidence supports while acknowledging its limits.', 'published', '{"stimulus_type":"text","blueprint":"logical-qualification"}', '13755dff0190d8e4f910e4328ff36261955c82b64b0703528bf7c44af1ff858c', 'english-bank-2000-v2', '{"generator":"scripts/generate-question-bank.mjs","version":"2.0.0","blueprint":"logical-qualification","ordinal":1,"locale":"en"}', 'english-bank:writing:hard:001'),
